:: Go back {"position":"1175,575","size":"100,100"}
You are a wanderer who has found themself in front of some ancient ruins. You have nothing with you except your clothes, but you find yourself irresistably tempted to enter and explore it anyways. Go inside?

(text-color:white)[''[[No]]'']
(text-colour:cyan)[''[[Yes]]'']


:: No {"position":"975,575","size":"100,100"}
Are you sure?

(text-colour:cyan)[''[[Go back]]'']
~~''Leave''~~


:: Yes {"position":"1300,575","size":"100,100"}
You march through the large doorway marking the crimson-colored temple's entrance, brushing through the vines that drape over it. 

Before you are two doorways. One is pitch black, its darkness intimidating you. The other, however, leads to a hallway illuminated by a (text-colour:cyan)[faint, blue light].
